<title>MALAYSIA: Carlsberg 1996 net 91.69 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Carlsberg 1996 net 91.69 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 89.9    vs	  75.5</p>
<p>    Net profit		  91.69   vs	  77.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		   672.24   vs	 581.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   128.99   vs	 108.14</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	50.0    vs	  35.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Carlsberg Brewery Malaysia Bhd is a manufacturer and distributor of alcoholic beverages.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
